{"ticker":"FACT","symbol":"FACT","instrumentId":3022424,"name":"Fact","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Agricultural","about":"The Fertilisers And Chemicals Travancore Limited (FACT), is India's first large-scale fertilizer plant. Initially a private sector venture, it transitioned to a public sector company in 1960 under the Government of India. FACT operates multiple divisions, including Udyogamandal and Cochin, producing a wide range of fertilizers and chemicals. The company also established FACT Engineering & Design Organisation (FEDO) and FACT Engineering Works (FEW) for engineering consultancy and fabrication. FACT has played a pivotal role in India's agricultural sector, continually expanding its capabilities and infrastructure, and remains a key player in the industry.","website":"www.fact.co.in","location":"Kochi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:19:32.450Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":775.4,"changePct":0.5380875202593163,"week52High":997.8,"week52Low":662.1},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹50,174 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,568 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"64,707,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"105"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"59,433,654"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.04%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"37.15"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"2.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.03"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.39"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"—"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"14–2,967"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"-2.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"2.16"},{"label":"Volume","value":"102,211"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"272,224"},{"label":"Master score","value":"46"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"27"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"50"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"157"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"B-"}],"earningsAnnual":{"headers":["Yea